stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> InStock: Initial Stock Import / Restock
    InStock --> UnderLock: SELECT FOR UPDATE Acquired
    UnderLock --> InStock: Rollback / Invariant Failure
    UnderLock --> Decremented: Atomic Decrement (stock >= qty)
    Decremented --> Committed: Transaction COMMIT
    Committed --> InStock: Subsequent Purchases Available
    Committed --> Depleted: Stock reaches 0
    Depleted --> InStock: Restock Adjustment Added
